[I] Compute `intelligent' differences between two files / lists

[T] Algorithm::Diff is a Perl module for computing the difference between
[T] two files, two strings or any other two lists of things. It uses an
[T] algorithm similar to the one of the Unix diff program and is guaranteed
[T] to find the smallest possible set of differences; the package also
[T] includes sample diff programs built on it.

[U] https://metacpan.org/pod/Algorithm::Diff

